<title>USA: Aura Systems signs $12 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Aura Systems signs $12 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, CALIF. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aura Systems Inc said it signed a $12 million revolving credit line, to be secured by the company's receivables and inventory.</p>
<p>The company did not say which bank granted it the credit. It also did not say for what purpose it would use the credit.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it would use the credit for &quot;growth.&quot;</p>
<p>Aura officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
